### Component 4: Screens (Vertical Mobile Layout)

Each screen will adapt the web App's 3-column desktop layout to a **single-column vertical scroll** layout for mobile.

#### [NEW] `screens/LoginScreen.kt`
- Match web App login design: logo + title + email/password form + Google Sign-In
- Gradient blue background
- Centered card layout

#### [NEW] `screens/DashboardScreen.kt`
- **Header**: Welcome + streak + "New Task" button
- **Clock & Date card** (scrolled, not pinned like web)
- **Today's Uniform card**
- **Today's Schedule card** (list of today's classes)
- **Timer widget** (compact mode)
- **Weekly Progress chart**
- **Study Goals / Tasks list**
- **Quote of the Day card** (dark gradient)

#### [NEW] `screens/FocusModeScreen.kt`
- **Header**: Focus Mode title + subtitle
- **Full Timer** with Pomodoro/Short Break/Long Break tabs
- **Daily Streak widget**
- **Recent Sessions timeline**

#### [NEW] `screens/ScheduleScreen.kt`
- **Tab selector**: Classes | Exams | Uniforms
- **Classes tab**: Grid/list of class cards with icons, days, room, links
- **Add/Edit class modal**
- **Uniforms tab**: Day-by-day uniform input

#### [NEW] `screens/CalendarScreen.kt`
- **Monthly calendar grid** view
- **Event list** for selected day
- **Add/Edit event modal**
- **Roadmap tab**: 30-day upcoming events list

#### [NEW] `screens/ReportsScreen.kt`
- **Period selector**: This Week | This Month | All Time
- **Stats cards**: Total Study Time, Sessions, Pomodoros, Avg/Day
- **Daily Activity chart**

#### [NEW] `screens/SettingsScreen.kt`
- **Profile Info**: Display name edit
- **Timer Settings**: Focus/Short Break/Long Break duration
- **Language toggle**: EN/ID
- **Dark Mode toggle**
- **Danger Zone**: Sign Out, Delete All Data

