### Component 6: Data Layer Additions

#### [MODIFY] [BackendRepository.kt](file:///d:/SECURE/000001Studyflowproject/Mobile/app/src/main/java/com/studyflow/nativeapp/BackendRepository.kt)
- Add `calendarEventsService`: CRUD for `calendarEvents` subcollection
- Add `uniformsService`: Read/write `settings/uniforms` document  
- Add `studySessionsService.addSession()`: Write new sessions + update streak
- All via direct Firestore (matching web App's data structure)

#### [MODIFY] [BackendApi.kt](file:///d:/SECURE/000001Studyflowproject/Mobile/app/src/main/java/com/studyflow/nativeapp/BackendApi.kt)
